<<wait 3>>
<<picture YarnCommands intro_1>>
<<fade_in YarnCommands 3>>
…
Dark.
Cold.
You lay motionless, unable to move.
How could you move? Everything is pointless.
The horrible sight sticks deeply into your mind.
The assailants are gone, but they took everything.
Blood. Dead bodies. Pure dread.
Your family. 
They gave everything to hide you from this slaughter. 
And now, all that remains is the darkness slowly closing in around you. 
You've given up on life. You no longer have the strength—or the will—to stand. You can only wait for the inevitable. 
As fear takes hold of you, your mind drifts back to the life you once imagined. What kind of person could you have become? 

You reminisce about your aspirations. What kind of person did you dream of becoming? 
-> Adventurer #paneldetails=Gain_2_Proficiency
	<<change_proficiency 2>>
	You envisioned a life stepping beyond the safety of the known world.
	<<jump adventurer_purpose>>
-> Scholar #paneldetails=Gain_1_Wisdom
	<<change_wisdom 1>>
	You envisioned a life dedicated to the pursuit of knowledge.
	<<jump scholar_purpose>>
-> Doctor #paneldetails=Gain_5_Metabolism
	<<change_metabolism 5>>
	You envisioned a life devoted to the study and practice of medicine.
